      },
      "message": "Merge origin/main into pick-3507: refresh past #3472 and fix the review findings\n\nFinding 1 (P1, kerf side): merge the merged #3472 parent. It replaces the stock-overhang side rule with parting_law::chuck_side and reads the kerf side in part_kerf_refusal itself, so the verdict cannot follow the generator's side choice.\n\nFinding 2 (P1, stale cache): merge the merged #3472 parent. operation/stamp.rs now salts a Part stamp with part-off-kerf-side-v1, so a saved unsafe part-off reads Stale and blocks the post. The regression pins part_off_saved_before_3452.rs and the recorded fixture are present.\n\nFinding 3 (catalog list): after the merge, the two .camproj files and the four NC files are on main with #3472, so this PR has no golden or catalog diff. The PR body will name that.\n\nConflict: crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs. Both sides assert the part-off reaches Z12. Took main's stricter assertion that also checks F0.02.\n\nRefs #3451\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
