      "message": "Merge the fork refresh d6f3edaa4 into the gated refresh\n\nThe fork branch received an equivalent refresh (d6f3edaa4) on an older main. This merge keeps the gated tree f8a5821bb, which is newer on main, and includes that refresh.\n\nFindings resolved: the #3472 parent is merged, so the kerf side rule is chuck_side and part_kerf_refusal reads the side itself (finding 1). The Part stamp salt part-off-kerf-side-v1 and the saved-project regression are present (finding 2). The catalog project files are on main with #3472, so this PR has no golden or catalog diff (finding 3). Heavy is a tool, not a merge condition, and this P3 PR runs none (finding 4, #3558).\n\nConflict in crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs: both sides asserted Z12; took main's stricter F0.02 form.\n\nReadings: quick gate 686 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled, 61.5 min. spot_drill_verify 4, spot_drill_radius 11, part_off_saved_before_3452 2, turning_part_kerf 6, example_catalog cone-thread 1. Clippy camcraft-app and camcraft-sim clean.\n\nRefs #3451\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
